{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "70ac1380-f299-835e-83fa-c6a5dd9675a0",
  "created_at": "2025-12-08T12:10:59-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Julio Cordero",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sousa",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T12:08:15-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Kevin."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T12:08:18-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, hi Kevin. Julio Cordero. I'm calling about the water at the end of my block, again. I'm on Malbone Road, four forty-four, up in the North End."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T12:08:28-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, four forty-four Malbone. And what's it doing, the water?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T12:08:32-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's sitting there. The low spot at the end of the block is under about a foot of water. That's two days after the nor'easter ended Saturday. Two days. It's Monday and it hasn't gone anywhere."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T12:08:44-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, that's a lot of standing water. Is it the drain at the corner, you think, not taking it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T12:08:51-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's what I'm saying, nothing's taking it. And the sidewalk, you can't even walk on it. It's a sheet of mud and grit, all of it washed down from the street and left there. I got tenants trying to get to their cars in that."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T12:09:06-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right, right. So I'm putting down, standing water, low spot at the end of the block, sidewalk covered in silt. Got it. Anything going into the buildings?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T12:09:15-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Not yet, no. But it's creeping. I'm not waiting till it does. I want somebody out here. Nobody came after the storm, nobody checked it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T12:09:24-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. Let me get this entered. Can I get a good callback number in case the crew needs to reach you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T12:09:31-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four-oh-one, five-five-five, oh-one-eight-nine."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T12:09:33-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four-oh-one, five-five-five, oh-one-eight-nine. Perfect."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T12:09:35-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So is there a work order going in? Because I want to know that. And for what date. Not just somebody wrote it on a pad."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T12:09:44-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yep, I'm opening the work order right now, while we're talking. Storm drain not draining, flooding and debris on the sidewalk. Hang on a sec, let me see what the schedule looks like."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T12:09:55-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Go ahead. I'm looking at the clock on the wall here, I got a guy coming at one o'clock to look at a boiler, so I got to be out the door soon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T12:10:06-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem, almost there. Okay, so after a storm like this the drain crews have a pile of them. This one's going on the list for this week, most likely Tuesday or Wednesday. I'll flag it as standing water on a walkway so it gets bumped up."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T12:10:21-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Tuesday or Wednesday. Okay. That's better than last time, I'll say that. You'll have it in writing, the work order?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T12:10:28-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'll give you the work order number before you go. It's coming up now. I'll read it off slowly so you can grab a pen."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T12:10:37-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Go. I got a pen."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T12:10:39-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's going to be on the confirmation screen, one second. Okay, it's W-O, four, four, four, zero, nine. Easy to remember with your house number in it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T12:10:48-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four-four-four-zero-nine. Got it. Alright, Kevin, thanks. If it's not done by Wednesday I'm calling back."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T12:10:54-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Fair enough. Call me with that number and I'll chase it. Take care, Julio."
    }
  ],
